  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-ca80e7780b993628ebc3a8",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "1-3回合：1级拿孙膑和曜，可以等孙膑和曜都觉醒了再升二级，3回合竞拍墨子＞芈月＞西施",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 17,
          "paragraph_end": 17
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-65c89b530b8059e3e6b006",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "4-7回合：棋手升3级，找齐阵容中的芈月、墨子、西施，觉醒阵容中的所有的英雄，曜有多少拿多少，7回合竞拍可以选择扁鹊和太乙真人",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 18,
          "paragraph_end": 18
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-32a0e43f78026adf4db87d",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "8回合以后：棋手升5级补齐扁鹊和太乙真人，期间有加等级的效果牌也可以拿，英雄牌比如蒙犽也可以拿，后期操作就是不停的打合成和效果牌来提升曜的等级，11回合竞拍可以拿破镜之境、众星闪耀、众星拱月，缺装备可以拿军械库",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 19,
          "paragraph_end": 19
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-e18e561d6c79adebd342bc",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "这套阵容总体思路是孙膑在曜释放技能时可以为曜增加永久等级，曜合成时额外增加等级，芈月在使用效果牌时给曜增加等级，墨子在曜的护盾被击破时提供永久生命上限，西施的效果牌每回合减少曜的法力值上限，扁鹊在曜的护盾被击破时提供伤害，太乙真人提供复活。这一套阵容的其他6张英雄牌都能为曜提供强化",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 4,
          "paragraph_end": 4
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5622465d44b80d5a8f8b67",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "有青莲剑谱优先获取，对曜的提升很大，优先青莲剑谱 > 护命灵珠",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-f3b3ef4fdf210dc075ea7f",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "有天赋牌逐星优先获取，曜和李白同时上场，李白释放三次技能后可以卖掉，曜就学会了李白的技能，大幅提高曜的上限。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-65007c08485db35df7b8a7",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "前期锦囊牌如果有遗志，可以先拿着，在拿到遗志的情况下可以选择红叶染锋，后期如果打不赢也可以遗志曜转海月，博一手上限，打得赢就不转；没有遗志就不选择红叶染锋。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 8,
          "paragraph_end": 8
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c0846b7a299cfc236ce77f",
      "section": "推荐天赋及原因",
      "text": "优先选择给曜提供等级和伤害的的天赋，如逐鹿新援、破妄之刃、逐星。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-d6f9c290342a1bdc976a5b",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "曜装备推荐：不死鸟之眼、凝渊、红魔，特殊装备推荐青莲剑谱、护命灵珠。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-560cda7b905c496c5b4681",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "其他肉装给墨子，输出装给孙膑。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-d48be8cd4e099781740ea0",
      "section": "棋手技能推荐",
      "text": "阿离，技能要记得主动释放，曜大量击杀英雄解锁秘技牌，优先选择枫华之刃、一叶双生等增加伤害的秘技天赋，6级棋手天赋三选一，可以选择落英汲取。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
          "paragraph_start": 15,
          "paragraph_end": 15
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-83fd6918ebf9ae0951093b",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "材料已给出的棋手升级操作按前、中、后期执行；未明确各中间等阶的独立找牌目标、停留边界或六阶后资源安排时，仍待确认。升级前同时比较当前战力、掉血风险、核心与觉醒进度，以及升级后买牌预算；不能仅因到达某回合就忽略保命战力。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-25f57284a72a040d4e72508a3d2c4c4937ce4158463acc805209c1788131606a",
